# Dimmer
# Level 2 - Next steps
#
# Turn a knob to set how bright an LED is.
# You learn: connecting an input to an output - a percentage goes straight from one to the other.
# You need: a potentiometer on A0 (outer legs to 5V and GND) and an LED with a 220 ohm resistor on pin 9.

board uno

knob = analog A0
lamp = pin 9 as pwm

every 20 ms:
    lamp.write(knob.percent)       # 0 % to 100 % in, 0 % to 100 % out
